<title>USA: Collective Bancorp investors approve merger.</title>
<headline>Collective Bancorp investors approve merger.</headline>
<dateline>EGG HARBOR, N.J. 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Collective Bancorp Inc said on Wednesday that its stockholders had voted to approve a proposed merger with Summit Bancorp.</p>
<p>Under the the terms of the agreement, each outstanding share of Collective Bancorp common stock will be exchanged for 0.895 shares of Summit Bancorp common stock, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>The company said it expected the merger to close in the third quarter.</p>
</text>
